<div class="px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 lg:px-8 xl:px-28 xl:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl lg:mx-0">
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-semibold text-slate-100 tracking-tight">
      PhireFlight
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300">
      A flight recorder for Phoenix contexts. Every request becomes a visual 'flight' you can replay.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">
      You've been writing about contexts as the unit of architecture. PhireFlight records those contexts at runtime and lets an AI narrate what's actually happening.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
      Ready to record your first flight.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4">
      <.link navigate={~p"/apps"} class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-orange-500 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-orange-600 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-500 transition-colors">
        View Apps →
      </.link>
      <.link navigate={~p"/demo/products"} class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-700 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-600 transition-colors">
        DemoShop →
      </.link>
      <%= if assigns[:demo_mode] do %>
        <.link navigate={~p"/demo/guide"} class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-700 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-600 transition-colors">
          Demo Mode →
        </.link>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
